---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Community — Icons reGospeled" description="Wings, Whiskey & the Word, Movies for Humans, men's retreats, and more — real table fellowship rooted in the hospitality of Christ.">

  <section class="hero" style="padding-bottom:0;">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Come to the table</p>
      <h1>Faith is better with a table and people around it.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Our gatherings are marked by grace, attentiveness, and real human connection — places to bring your questions, wounds, hopes, and stories, and be known without being shamed.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="narrow">

      <div class="program" data-reveal>
        <div class="icon">🍗</div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Wings, Whiskey &amp; the Word</h3>
          <p>A bi-weekly gathering built on shared meals and meaningful conversation about theology, psychology, and the real stories we carry. More than a casual hangout — an invitation to belong, to be known, and to share in fellowship that's grounded and deeply human.</p>
          <p style="font-size:14px;">BYOA (bring your own alcohol). The ministry does not provide or serve alcohol. Participants sign a release/waiver and agree to <em>Christlike</em> conduct. No underage drinking, ever.</p>
          <a class="textlink" href="https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61569046571090">See upcoming gatherings on Facebook →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="program" data-reveal>
        <div class="icon">🎬</div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Movies for Humans: Cinema for the Common Good</h3>
          <p>A monthly gathering that uses film and conversation to cultivate Christlike awareness, honesty, and deeper connection. A thoughtful movie, a meal, and real discussion — an invitation to pay attention together and become more awake, compassionate, and human in one another's presence.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="program" data-reveal>
        <div class="icon">🏕️</div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Men's Retreat</h3>
          <p>A gathering designed to help men slow down, breathe deeply, and reconnect with God, themselves, and one another. Set apart from the noise of everyday life, it makes room for worship, honest conversation, rest, and real brotherhood.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="program" data-reveal>
        <div class="icon">🥃</div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Kentucky Gentlemen's Retreat — Theology. Worship. Whiskey.</h3>
          <p>Not our own event, but so aligned with our mission that we go every year — always a highlight. Trinitarian and Christological, with a heavy emphasis on fellowship. Featuring Dr. C. Baxter Kruger (Torrance scholar) and host John Crowder. <strong>Oct 1–3, 2026 · Bardstown, KY.</strong></p>
          <a class="textlink" href="https://www.johncrowder.net/collections/events/products/scotland-kentucky-mens-retreats-2026?variant=46762249781403">Details &amp; registration →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="program" data-reveal>
        <div class="icon">🌮</div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Rethinking God with Tacos</h3>
          <p>Another aligned gathering we love: Jason Clark, Baxter Kruger, John Crowder, and Justin &amp; Abi Stumvoll. <strong>Sept 24–26, 2026 · Charlotte, NC.</strong></p>
          <a class="textlink" href="https://perichoresis.org/event/tacos-reunion-2026/">Learn more →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="program" data-reveal>
        <div class="icon">🎟️</div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Restoring the Icon on the reGospeled Way</h3>
          <p>We offer a $25 gift to individuals attending Christian conferences that align with the ministry's vision — a small gesture to help offset costs and encourage spiritual growth and community. As funds allow, it may be received more than once.</p>
          <a class="textlink" href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScpdJDO18mxifdY8SNbeg85pRsvwSFvKAKC8Pcj5xQG-t6QuA/viewform?usp=header">Apply for the gift →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="program" data-reveal>
        <div class="icon">🤍</div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>We support the State College Pregnancy Resource Clinic</h3>
          <p>Icons reGospeled financially supports the PRC, a local 501(c)(3) whose care for persons and families reflects what we hope to embody: the human person as an icon of God to be treated with dignity, patience, and reverence.</p>
          <a class="textlink" href="https://www.scprc.com/">Visit the PRC →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band" data-reveal>
    <div class="narrow">
      <h2>Want to know when we gather next?</h2>
      <p class="lead">Get occasional letters with upcoming gatherings and a good next book. No noise.</p>
      <form class="signup center" novalidate>
        <input type="email" placeholder="you@email.com" aria-label="Your email" autocomplete="email" required>
        <button class="btn btn-gold" type="submit">Keep me posted</button>
      </form>
      <p class="form-msg" style="text-align:center;"></p>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>
